{"availability":"available","full":"COFFEETALES/wasm2lang","name":"wasm2lang","description":"Compile once to WebAssembly. Ship everywhere as source code.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":19,"forks":1,"created":"2022-01-18T17:58:40Z","updated":"2026-10-05T21:37:33Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://coffeetales.github.io/wasm2lang/","topics":["asmjs","compiler","java","php","transpiler","webassembly"],"demo":"https://coffeetales.github.io/wasm2lang/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T16:58:45.022Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T16:58:45.022Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T16:58:45.022Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T23:32:27.929Z","stars":18,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T03:21:19.340Z","stars":18,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T16:58:45.022Z","stars":19,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Compile once to WebAssembly. Ship everywhere as source code.","Try it in the Playground → -- no install, no server. Pick a sample, pick a backend, see the generated code.","wasm2lang turns a WebAssembly module into native source code that each host toolchain can compile, inline, and optimize directly -- asm.js, JavaScript, PHP, Java, or C#. No interpreter. No runtime bridge. No WASM engine embedded at runtime."],"features":["Reach platforms WASM cannot. Shared PHP hosting. Classloader-locked Java","Skip the JIT-over-JIT tax. Emitted code is compiled by HotSpot, OPcache,","One logic base, five ecosystems. Fix the bug in one .wasm, re-emit to","Structural passes -- constant-condition folding, loop simplification,","block-loop fusion, switch dispatch detection, if-else recovery, block-guard elision, redundant-block removal, local init folding."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/COFFEETALES/wasm2lang/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"555d89f5e4dcc412521e194ead704be4625a04748b0528c1b6a786a3663a6252","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T23:32:28.038Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"202